{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`We all changed, huh? I don't miss being dead-eyed and depressed at all, but Sab's still not fully adjusted to the whole. You know. Being alive thing.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:47:07.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732438688849951","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Soft banjo music can be heard in the treetops above the group.","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:47:24.286000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732507131486249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Well, a body's a body!\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:47:26.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732517621432342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"That sounded more positive in my head.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:47:32.992000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732543647088661","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Well, yes, but an alive body is very different to a not alive body.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:48:04.856000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732677294424104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Guess I can't complain... I could be... Any... Body.\" No laughs","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:48:41.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732829090471937","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"You know, I see the point you're getting at here but also just....\" she hops on the branches to get a little closer. \"A little thought, if I may?\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:48:54.207000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732884287512616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`You can. She's sleeping, but I'll pass it on later.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:49:17.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872732981033304114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`An aside, sleep is so weird. You just... stop moving but instead of thinking about your day you hallucinate weird stuff?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:49:41.137000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733081126195210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I lived as an elf for 400 something years, and then also a week. We didn't actually sleep.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:50:28.453000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733279583862794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Then I was a hexblood for 400 something more years. I learned about sleep then.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:50:48.159000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733362236842024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"There's a lot of change going on in this city. Everyone should find something to hold on to while everything changes. Sabby must be glad to have you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:52:04.469000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733682304176188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"they look like they're about to cry. `Helping her's my job, I'm just doing what I can.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:52:43.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733843969409054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`There's still so much we don't know.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:53:00.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872733915268403220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"It's just different bones carrying the same soul.\" She shrugs. \"It's a marvel to discover all the new things you can do. But it's still a loss to remember all the things you can't anymore.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:54:16.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872734234517843968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Lucy nods. \"Guess that settles it then.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:54:41.574000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872734341250289674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Settles it? You had some debate?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:55:31.571000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872734550952902656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"It's a new face, but it's still your expressions. It's a new voice, but it's still your words. It's a new body, but it's still your actions.\" Irynx nods. \"Those are my thoughts, anyway.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:56:11.805000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-05T06:56:23.158000Z","id":"872734719706550352","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Lucy's eyes dim down. She shakes her head and blinks.","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:56:24.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872734773234245652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Lucy purs.","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:56:59.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872734917920968746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Irynx narrows her eyes. \"That's really all I had. A thought's a rare and passing thing. You gotta say it out loud, so that someone can remember it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:57:25.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735028503789618","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Usually, that someone is me.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:57:38.551000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735083545628754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`I get that. Sab can talk now, but she still prefers telepathy if it's just with me, it's something familiar.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:58:21.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735265112854548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Come here, buddy,\" Irynx spreads her wings.\n\nOrphy tries to hide behind Lucy and Kukudh. `No, stop! I like chin scritches but it's weird when you look like me!`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:58:51.052000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735387636875284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Lucy purs happily as bo lands beside the group of familiars from above. \"We need ta hold on to what we are, right?\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:59:42.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735603123445801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Kukudh laughs and transforms into a four-winged swole raven. `Come heeere~`","created_at":"2021-08-05T06:59:45.981000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735618025807882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"If we keep changing... Will we even be ourselves anymore?\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:00:30.664000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735805439868999","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`No! No! Don't like!` Orphy hops down to a lower branch. `Not when you're MY SIZE.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:00:39.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735842400075776","reply_to_id":"872735618025807882","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"That's a fun thing to think about, Mr. Bo. I think...... who knows?\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:01:05.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872735951842066434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I always tell people, I've lived a very long time. The Irynx who was born a thousand years ago is not the same as the Irynx in the branches right now.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:01:54.103000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736155408424990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"But I am still Irynx.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:02:07.660000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736212270592020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"they transform into the crab-like spider again. `Hey, now I'm smaller than you so it's alright, right?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:02:10.893000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736225830776872","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Well, now I'm putting you in my mouth!` Orphy goes after Kukudh.","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:02:33.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736321049878538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"they curse in Infernal and turn back into an imp.","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:02:44.725000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736367732461598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Bo smiles... \"Bo needs to stay Bo. The Mender taught me that.... If i keep changing... Will i still be Bo?\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:02:45.677000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736371725434890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`I don't taste good! Probably.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:03:07.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736462934777917","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Change and loss are two different things. Just because you became something different doesn't mean you lost yourself.\"\n\nShe tilts her head. \"I think you won't be the *same* Bo, but you're still Bo.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:03:54.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736661673508905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Yeah, Sab really found herself after froggification. That's a word now, fight me. She didn't have to be scared of people wanting her double-dead any more.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:04:43.724000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872736866850451476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Orphy laughs. `Hahaha! Yeah, now she just has to be scared of people wanting her normal-dead.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:05:41.513000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-05T07:05:46.346000Z","id":"872737109235085362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Well, yeah, but don't we all?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:05:57.232000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872737175165370438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Do not we all indeed.\" Irynx nods.","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:06:54.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872737413900935171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Bo smiles.","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:08:53.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872737914566635522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"The ravens gave me this body.\" His smile falters. Lucy nudges him. \"I wonder if Ma will ever accept me like this.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:10:12.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872738245073596426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`People who actually care about you will accept you for who you are. Shame we were too deep in despair to realise that one before.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:11:39.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872738611622187058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Ravens gave me my old body back too, and my current one. And also technically they also gave me Eurus so they also gave me this body.\" The white raven does a nice little booty wiggle. \"I'm sure you can get your old form back somehow. Lots of possibilities in this city.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:12:20.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872738783362187264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Bo shakes his head. \"Naw, think I might try and keep this one for a while.\" He laughs","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:13:10.085000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872738990682419220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Heh. I actually didn't want my old one much anyway, when I went to the ravens. Was I glad to have it? Yes. But all I really wanted was out of my old one.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:13:51.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739163919765565","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Going to the ravens was a new start for me, and as fine as I was having my old self back, I don't think it was right to ring in the new life in old bones. Literal bones, not Old Bones.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:14:47.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739397739618304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Honestly, we still don't even know what Sab was before... well, no, I guess what whoever she inherited the body from was. It's something it'd be nice to find out if it comes up, but... it's not a key facet of existence any more.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:15:32.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739586470711298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Bo laughs hysterically","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:16:09.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739742884724746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"And i gave my body to bring bones back!\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:16:36.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739856080572496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"(The irony in having a friend named bones lol)","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:17:09.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872739996497489981","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"If I had to guess, she used to be a body that didn't want to lie down. Just kept on going. A skeleton that didn't want to carry a soul, made one of its own. That's Sabby. But that's a *crazy* thinking.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:19:36.111000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-05T07:20:56.884000Z","id":"872740609792806962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Oh, I guess that's what that one Infernal proverb means. Your bones. My bones. Bones' bones. Bone bone bone.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:19:59.933000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872740709709529098","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"they shrug. `But then where did she---and where did I---come from?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:20:16.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872740779754418206","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Do you want more of my theories? My head's all over the place sometimes, I can't promise you they're correct.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:21:29.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872741086911692860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Sure. It's always something to think about.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:21:41.710000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872741136593199175","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`How can I be lost childhood memories without a childhood to spawn from?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:22:02.146000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872741222307991583","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
