{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Well, you being lost childhood memories and then also that bit about the mass of horrors is.... a little mean to yourself? Just saying.\"","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:26:21.204000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872742308875993088","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`It is? You'd think childhood would be before It came into play.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:26:49.216000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872742426366849034","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Who makes a pact with a mass of horrors as a kid? Is that even legal?`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:27:04.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872742489335947324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
