{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"`Given my... state at the time... I could well have been related to It somehow.`","created_at":"2021-08-05T07:28:22.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"872742817091432518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
